    }
  ],
  "explanation": "Execution flow: Transition Blueprint Builder → Transition Economics Analyst → Commercial Migration Strategist → Integrated Transition Plan Refiner → Board Readiness Quality Gate. If the gate outputs revise, it routes back to the Integrated Transition Plan Refiner, which incorporates the detailed assessment; this review-and-revision cycle may repeat up to three times. If the gate outputs pass, the plan proceeds to the Executive Plan Polisher. The design combines financial scenario analysis with customer, pricing, sales-compensation, and rollout strategy before integration, then tests the result against board-readiness, customer-rights, retention, and financial-coherence standards. It ends with a dedicated polishing step that produces a clear executive deliverable."
